   "harm": "ReadPragmaInteger throwing would propagate and set database status to FAILED_LOAD instead of FAILED_VERIFY on verification failures",
   "hash": "1d7a747c8796b89d",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:48:26+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:2518476250",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:2518476250",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "part": 1,
   "pin": null,
   "question": "",
   "quote": "Before, on `Verify()` failure (return `false`) `MakeSQLiteDatabase()` would have set `status = DatabaseStatus::FAILED_VERIFY` and now (exception) it would set `status = DatabaseStatus::FAILED_LOAD`. Is this ok?",
   "request": "",
   "status": "fixed",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2025-11-17",
    "by": "achow101",
    "id": "rc:2535564145",
    "quote": "I've changed this to catch the exception and return `std::nullopt`."
   },
   "status_note": "",
   "type": "objection",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/33033#discussion_r2518476250"
  },
  {
   "association": "MEMBER",
   "at": "2025-11-12",
